OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after woman injured by
OL,4,Ahit-and-run driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal has been launched after a
OL,7,Fwoman was hit by a car which failed to
OL,8,Fstop at a zebra crossing in Nottingham.
OL,10,FPolice were called after a silver Audi
OL,11,Fhit the woman on the junction of St
OL,12,FAnn's Well Road and Hedderley Walk, in
OL,13,FSt Ann's, at around 16:30 BST on 30
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FThe woman suffered swelling to her knee
OL,17,Fwhen the vehicle clipped her leg,
OL,18,Fbefore continuing in a north easterly
OL,19,Fdirection from Nottingham city centre,
OL,20,Fpolice said.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
